  "description": "The Urbx e-bike is the ideal bike for the modern city dweller, suitable for commuting or for adventure and exploration. The bike is particularly comfortable, as its reduced weight means you can easily carry the Urbx up the stairs and park it in a comfortable spot. When it comes to drive, you can choose between a belt drive or a traditional chain with derailleur. The 250W and 30Nm Bafang G310 motor ensures you can handle all courses, and the integrated 360 Wh battery gives you plenty of riding range. The front and rear lights are neatly hidden in the handlebars and seatpost. The solid aluminium mudguard protects you from splashing dirt and has an integrated carrier on which you can clip panniers. Brake with the powerful and reliable Shimano hydraulic disc brakes. Wherever you go, with the Urbx e-bike you do it in style.",
